! D.520 S starboard half wing - shell model reconstructed from the 1940 manual
! Units N, m, kg, Pa.  Axes: X aft from spinner tip, Y starboard, Z up.
! Loads below are for n = 1 g (lift up, inertia down) and are multiplied by NLF.
! Usage: /INPUT,D520_wing_r3,mac  (or Workbench: Mechanical APDL system, Add Input File)
FINISH
/CLEAR,NOSTART
/PREP7
